      "comment" : "Book reader: kicker over a chapter's title, the part's name then the chapter's heading, like The Third Book · Chapter V\nChapel day strip, VoiceOver: the weekday, then the day's feast, like Thursday · St. Monica\nChapel, Today tile: second line of the Night Prayers row, when it is said (like At bedtime), then the season's song to Mary\nConsecration day overview: the period of the preparation and what it is about, like Week 1 · Knowing Yourself\nLock Screen: the line under a chant's title while a set is sung: the set's name, then where it stands, like 2 of 4\nSearch result for a meditation set: its author, then its mysteries, like Fulton Sheen · Joyful Mysteries",
