    "A Rosary a day is the oldest way to keep it." : {
      "comment" : "Daily prayer reminder notification in May, the month of Mary: its text under the title. Warm and inviting, never scolding; under about 75 characters",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un Rosario al día es la forma más antigua de honrarla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A Rosary has five mysteries. For each one, think on its scene and pray one Our Father, ten Hail Marys, a Glory Be and the Fatima Prayer, together called a decade. The app guides you through all five, with an optional meditation for each: a short reading from a saint or from Scripture." : {
      "comment" : "About Lumen Viae: a section's text",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un Rosario tiene cinco misterios. En cada uno, contempla su escena y reza un Padrenuestro, diez avemarías, un Gloria y la Oración de Fátima; juntos se llaman una decena. La app te guía por los cinco, con una meditación opcional para cada uno: una breve lectura de un santo o de la Escritura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A SAYING FOR TODAY" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "UNA FRASE PARA HOY"
          }
        }
      }
    },
