    },
    "A few short prayers on waking, giving the day to God." : {
      "comment" : "Prayers tab: one sentence saying what an order of prayer is",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unas breves oraciones al despertar, para ofrecer el día a Dios."
