    },
    "A short course for someone new to it, then a guided first Rosary, one prayer at a time" : {
      "comment" : "What's New sheet: one plain line under How to Pray the Rosary, the beginner's course, saying what it is",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un curso breve para quien empieza y luego un primer Rosario guiado, una oración a la vez"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short prayer to Mary at 6 AM, noon and 6 PM, recalling the angel's message to her." : {
      "comment" : "Chapel focus block: italic line for the Angelus",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una breve oración a María a las 6 a. m., al mediodía y a las 6 p. m., que recuerda el mensaje del ángel."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short prayer to Mary at 6 AM, noon and 6 PM." : {
      "comment" : "Prayers tab, home's hour row: one short line saying what an order of prayer of the day is, under its name",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una breve oración a María a las 6 a. m., al mediodía y a las 6 p. m."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short reading on the mystery" : {
      "comment" : "Onboarding, What You'll Hear slide: the first of a decade's four parts, the meditation",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una lectura breve sobre el misterio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A short reflection on the mystery, often with a prayer at the end. The words come from preachers and the Church's great teachers. Read it once, then keep it in mind through the ten Hail Marys.\n\nSt. Alphonsus Liguori · Venerable Fulton J. Sheen · St. John Henry Newman · St. Thomas Aquinas" : {
      "comment" : "Kinds of Meditation sheet, the Reflections card: what this kind of meditation is, then after a blank line some authors who wrote it (keep the names; the blank line stays)",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Una breve reflexión sobre el misterio, a menudo con una oración al final. Las palabras vienen de predicadores y de los grandes maestros de la Iglesia. Léela una vez y luego tenla presente durante las diez avemarías.\n\nSan Alfonso María de Ligorio · Venerable Fulton J. Sheen · San John Henry Newman · Santo Tomás de Aquino"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A single strike of a small bronze bell" : {
      "comment" : "Settings, Reminder Sound: what the sound is like",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un solo toque de una pequeña campana de bronce"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A small, steady thing" : {
      "comment" : "Daily prayer reminder notification for readers building a daily habit: its title, shown in bold. Warm and inviting, never scolding; under about 35 characters",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Algo pequeño y constante"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tap on Pray starts this one, with no menu on the way." : {
      "comment" : "Pray button editor: note under the tap section",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Al tocar Rezar empieza esta, sin pasar por ningún menú."
