    "Almost everything. Your journal, your prayer record and streak, your place in every book and your settings are kept on this device and never sent to us. They leave it only in your iPhone's own iCloud Backup, if you have it on, under Apple's privacy policy." : {
      "comment" : "Privacy Policy: a section's text; keep it as plain and exact as the English",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Casi todo. Tu diario, tu registro de oración y tu racha, tu lugar en cada libro y tus ajustes se guardan en este dispositivo y nunca nos llegan. Solo salen de él en la copia de seguridad de iCloud de tu propio iPhone, si la tienes activada, bajo la política de privacidad de Apple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
