    "Choose it on the Rosary's own page before you pray, or in Settings under The Rosary: with Meditation Only you hear the meditation and say the prayers yourself, and with Whole Rosary you hear every prayer, the beads moving with the voice. During the prayer, the play button starts and pauses the voice, and the buttons beside it move 10 seconds, or a whole prayer with Whole Rosary." : {
