    "London · Milan · Assisi" : {
      "comment" : "St. Carlo Acutis page: small capitals kicker over the section title His Life",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Londres · Milán · Asís"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Longer passages that place you within the mystery: what was seen, heard, and felt there. Read slowly. You do not need to finish the page before the ten Hail Marys end.\n\nBlessed Anne Catherine Emmerich · Venerable Mary of Agreda · St. Ignatius of Loyola · Fr. Frederick William Faber" : {
      "comment" : "Kinds of Meditation sheet, the Inside the Scene card: what this kind of meditation is, then after a blank line some authors who wrote it (keep the names; the blank line stays)",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lecturas más largas que te sitúan dentro del misterio: lo que allí se vio, se oyó y se sintió. Lee despacio. No necesitas terminar la página antes de que acaben las diez avemarías.\n\nBeata Ana Catalina Emmerick · Venerable María de Jesús de Ágreda · San Ignacio de Loyola · P. Frederick William Faber"
          }
        }
      }
    },
