    "Lumen Viae %@" : {
      "comment" : "What's New sheet: small kicker over the title, the app's name and the version just installed, like Lumen Viae 4.1",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lumen Viae %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumen Viae helps you pray the Rosary each day, with a short reading for every mystery, and keeps the Church's other prayers close at hand. The mysteries are scenes from the lives of Jesus and Mary: the Joyful, Sorrowful, Glorious and Luminous, and the Seven Sorrows of Mary." : {
      "comment" : "About Lumen Viae: a section's text",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lumen Viae te ayuda a rezar el Rosario cada día, con una breve lectura para cada misterio, y tiene a la mano las demás oraciones de la Iglesia. Los misterios son escenas de la vida de Jesús y de María: los Gozosos, Dolorosos, Gloriosos y Luminosos, y los Siete Dolores de María."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumen Viae is made by one person, for the greater glory of God. If a credit here is wrong or missing, write through Send Feedback and it will be put right." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lumen Viae lo hace una sola persona, para mayor gloria de Dios. Si algún crédito aquí está mal o falta, escribe desde Enviar comentarios y se corregirá."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lumen Viae v%@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lumen Viae v%@"
