    "Mass of the Angels" : {
      "comment" : "Chant page: tile that opens the Mass of the Angels (Missa de Angelis, Mass VIII), a sung Mass setting\nTitle of the shelf of the Mass of the Angels (Missa de Angelis, Mass VIII), a sung Mass setting",
