    "Meditation Only" : {
      "comment" : "A Rosary choice's option, short, set in a two-part pill: Audio is Meditation Only, Read in Silence or Whole Rosary; Counting is On My Rosary or On the Screen\nOnboarding, What You'll Hear slide: a choice card's name; the voice reads only the meditation",
      "localizations" : {
