    "Move on to the medal, and close the last decade." : {
      "comment" : "Guided Rosary: what to do when the fifth and last decade closes",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pasa a la medalla y cierra la última decena."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move on to the next large bead. Before its Our Father, close the decade: the Glory Be, and the prayer Our Lady asked for at Fatima. You have prayed one decade." : {
      "comment" : "Guided Rosary: what to do when the first decade closes",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pasa a la siguiente cuenta grande. Antes de su Padrenuestro, cierra la decena: el Gloria y la oración que Nuestra Señora pidió en Fátima. Ya rezaste una decena."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move up" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver action on a row of the reader's own sung set: move it one place up",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Subir"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move up to the next large bead. Before anything else is said on it, give glory to the Holy Trinity." : {
      "comment" : "Guided Rosary: what to do before the Glory Be on the second large bead",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sube a la siguiente cuenta grande. Antes de decir cualquier otra cosa en ella, da gloria a la Santísima Trinidad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Move your fingers up to the first large bead, and pray the prayer Jesus taught His disciples." : {
      "comment" : "Guided Rosary: what to do before the first Our Father",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sube los dedos a la primera cuenta grande y reza la oración que Jesús enseñó a sus discípulos."
