    "On My Rosary" : {
      "comment" : "A Rosary choice's option, short, set in a two-part pill: Audio is Meditation Only, Read in Silence or Whole Rosary; Counting is On My Rosary or On the Screen\nOnboarding, How Will You Keep Count slide: a choice card's name; counting the Hail Marys on one's own rosary",
