    "On the Screen" : {
      "comment" : "A Rosary choice's option, short, set in a two-part pill: Audio is Meditation Only, Read in Silence or Whole Rosary; Counting is On My Rosary or On the Screen\nOnboarding, How Will You Keep Count slide: a choice card's name; counting on beads drawn on the screen",
      "localizations" : {
