            "value" : "En la pantalla"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the crucifix: make the Sign of the Cross, then sing the Creed." : {
      "comment" : "Chant library, a set of chants for an occasion: a red note between chants saying what happens or what to do; A Sung Rosary, at its start",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En el crucifijo: haz la Señal de la Cruz y luego canta el Credo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the home screen, tap the sliders at the top left, then Prayer Experience → Text Size. Drag the slider toward the larger \"A\" to increase the meditation text size." : {
      "comment" : "Help & Support: the answer to the question above it; names of buttons and settings must match the app's own words",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En la pantalla de inicio, toca los controles de arriba a la izquierda y luego Experiencia de oración → Tamaño del texto. Arrastra el control hacia la \"A\" más grande para agrandar el texto de las meditaciones."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the large bead, the Our Father." : {
      "comment" : "Guided Rosary: what to do on each later decade's Our Father",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En la cuenta grande, el Padrenuestro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the large bead, the Our Father. Keep the scene before you as you pray." : {
      "comment" : "Guided Rosary: what to do on the first decade's Our Father",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En la cuenta grande, el Padrenuestro. Mantén la escena ante ti mientras rezas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the large bead, then the three small beads, for faith, hope and charity." : {
      "comment" : "Chant library, a set of chants for an occasion: a red note between chants saying what happens or what to do; A Sung Rosary: the Our Father, three Hail Marys and the Glory Be follow",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En la cuenta grande y luego en las tres cuentas pequeñas, por la fe, la esperanza y la caridad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the next large bead, before its Our Father, close the decade." : {
      "comment" : "Guided Rosary: what to do when the second, third or fourth decade closes",
      "localizations" : {
