    "The Whole Rosary isn't recorded in this voice yet. Choose another voice." : {
      "comment" : "Prayer screen notice when the Rosary cannot be said aloud: no recordings in the chosen narration voice",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El Rosario completo aún no está grabado en esta voz. Elige otra voz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app is suitable for all ages. It asks no one for a name, an email or an account, and nothing it sends can tell us who you are." : {
      "comment" : "Privacy Policy: a section's text; keep it as plain and exact as the English",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La app es apta para todas las edades. No le pide a nadie un nombre, un correo ni una cuenta, y nada de lo que envía puede decirnos quién eres."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app keeps count, so you can just pray." : {
      "comment" : "Daily prayer reminder notification for readers drawn by peace and stillness: its text under the title. Warm and inviting, never scolding; under about 75 characters",
